	(text "X_F, X_WF:  finger side of a divider (FPGA output)\nX:  ball side (U1); DQx and RDQS_x also reach their\n    read finger (FPGA input, P pin): no series part\nVREF_Nx:  N finger of read bit x, 39 R into VREF_RD\nV1P2, V3P3:  host rails;   VDD1, VDD2H, VDDQ:  card rails\n\nAll nets are global labels or power symbols; the sheets\nhave no hierarchical pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 297.18 69.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1447e8b0-b0a2-5362-9b0d-28a941b916fa")
	)
	(text "DQ read fingers, RDQS loads,\nN-pin reference, DAC53401;  bank 66"
